  $('mm-content').innerHTML = `<div class="mm-welcome">
    <div class="mm-crumbs"><span>Shishah Sidrei Mishnah</span><span>ששה סדרי משנה</span></div>
    <h1>Mega Mishnah</h1>
    <p>All six orders of the Mishnah — sixty-three tractates — in vocalised Hebrew and English from Sefaria. Every Tanna is coloured by name so you can see who argues with whom, each mishnah shows where the Bavli, Yerushalmi and Tosefta take it up, and the panel opens Bartenura, Rambam, Tosafot Yom Tov, Tiferet Yisrael and the rest. Mark mishnayot as you learn them and the contents fill in toward a siyum.</p>
